    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one more thing—could you add a brief section on how we can proactively monitor these scaling events? i want to make sure we catch any unexpected resource exhaustion early before it actually impacts the end user. just a few bullet points on what metrics we should be watching.",
